  "rationale": "The workflow already applies path-filtered triggers, a concurrency group with cancel-in-progress scoped to the same ref, and a 25-minute job timeout. The dependency-caching candidate (P-LIT-GHA-CACHE / uv cache) is explicitly disabled via `enable-cache: false` because of a zizmor cache-poisoning audit, which matches the pattern's contraindication for mutable or untrusted cached content; re-enabling it would weaken that security posture. Stale-run cancellation (P-LIT-CANCEL-STALE) is contraindicated because this is a deployment workflow. No matrix, test suite, Bazel build, or scheduled trigger exists for the remaining patterns, so no supported optimization applies without a contraindication or an unrelated change.",
